From 0a368612703c8863c286f4eb537a5dd128caf91b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@invalid.local>
Date: Thu, 05 Nov 2026 16:12:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(env): preserve explicit credential provenance in diagnostics

Require explicit core and plugin authentication-secret classification, preserve
ordinary diagnostic values and actual provider environment bytes, and fail
preparation instead of dropping routing/authentication contributions.

Retain immutable managed-shell provenance across sync and preserve native
resume state. Apply the finite source-attested credential-slot projection
to all diagnostic event reads without rewriting retained originals.

Block populated unclassified stores before migration mutates any data.

---

